                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Solid solitaire game, you have to complete 100 levels and every now and then you have another mini game instead. The story isn't really there, it ain't much, but the game has a cute fairy theme. What I did find strange is that I made sure I had every level at 3 stars (the maximum) and that it didn't have an achievement lol. You only need 270 stars apparently, which isn't every level at 3 stars. So, if ur interested in achievements; it's easy peasy.\n\nI bought the game for only 89 cents, totally worth it.",
